# Parameter locks from the panel (docs/15 S8, the lab switch on), with
# Macro: step 5 held, SELECT past Step 2/2 to the first lock page, KNOB3
# and KNOB4 lock Timbre and Morph on it (each a lane, its base the knob's
# value, then a quiet lock); step 13 held, the lock page remembered, KNOB2
# locks Harmonics there. PLAY; with no step held KNOB3 turns Timbre down on
# its 7-bit grid and the lane's base follows (`abaseq`); PLAY/STOP just
# after the second pass's step 5 sends every lane back to its base (D6);
# PLAY again plays on from the bases.
--button 0.05:SEQ
--key 0.10:7:100:0.5
--turn 0.20:SELECT:1
--turn 0.25:SELECT:1
--turn 0.30:KNOB3:30
--turn 0.35:KNOB4:-20
--key 0.70:21:100:0.3
--turn 0.80:KNOB2:25
--button 1.10:PLAY/STOP
--turn 1.70:KNOB3:-10
--button 3.70:PLAY/STOP
--button 4.00:PLAY/STOP
